gers, infrared saunas, snow rooms, laconiums, caldarium chambers, and hammams, as well as cold plunge pools, large therapeutic jacuzzis, and rooms surrounding occupants with layers of body cleansing salt crystals. In addition, the company offers products under the ELEMIS, Grown Alchemist, Kerastase, Keratin Complex, Thermage, Dysport, GoodFeet arch supports, Hyperice, and Megawhite teeth whitening brands. OneSpaWorld Holdings Limited was founded in 2017 and is based in Nassau, Bahamas."}}